{
  "book": "3nephi",
  "bookName": "3 Nephi",
  "chapter": 12,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 466.882,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Jesus had spoken these words",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.617,
      "end": 6.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto Nephi, and to those who had been called,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.862,
      "end": 9.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(now the number of them who had been called,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.55,
      "end": 12.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and received power and authority to baptize, was twelve)",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.074,
      "end": 16.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, he stretched forth his hand unto the multitude,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 16.923,
      "end": 18.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cried unto them, saying:",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 18.821,
      "end": 23.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed are ye if ye shall give heed unto the words of these twelve",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 23.273,
      "end": 29.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom I have chosen from among you to minister unto you, and to be your servants;",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.212,
      "end": 31.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto them I have given power",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 31.621,
      "end": 34.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may baptize you with water;",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 34.402,
      "end": 36.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after that ye are baptized with water,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 37.136,
      "end": 40.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I will baptize you with fire and with the Holy Ghost;",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 40.892,
      "end": 45.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore blessed are ye if ye shall believe in me and be baptized,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 45.762,
      "end": 48.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after that ye have seen me and know that I am.",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.321,
      "end": 53.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, more blessed are they who shall believe in your words",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 54.099,
      "end": 57.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because that ye shall testify that ye have seen me",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 57.205,
      "end": 58.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye know that I am.",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 59.01,
      "end": 62.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, blessed are they who shall believe in your words,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 62.441,
      "end": 65.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and come down into the depths of humility and be baptized,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 66.011,
      "end": 69.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall be visited with fire and with the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 70.092,
      "end": 72.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall receive a remission of their sins.",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 73.326,
      "end": 76.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, blessed are the poor in spirit who come unto me,",
      "verse": "12:3",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 76.432,
      "end": 78.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for theirs is the kingdom of heaven.",
      "verse": "12:3",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 79.666,
      "end": 82.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, blessed are all they that mourn,",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 82.54,
      "end": 84.444,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall be comforted.",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 85.124,
      "end": 86.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed are the meek,",
      "verse": "12:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 87.069,
      "end": 89.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall inherit the earth.",
      "verse": "12:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 90.117,
      "end": 94.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed are all they who do hunger and thirst after righteousness,",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 94.43,
      "end": 97.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall be filled with the Holy Ghost.",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 98.082,
      "end": 100.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed are the merciful,",
      "verse": "12:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 100.212,
      "end": 102.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall obtain mercy.",
      "verse": "12:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 102.796,
      "end": 105.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed are all the pure in heart,",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 105.252,
      "end": 106.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall see God.",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 107.604,
      "end": 110.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed are all the peacemakers,",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 110.199,
      "end": 112.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall be called the children of God.",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 113.573,
      "end": 117.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed are all they who are persecuted for my name's sake,",
      "verse": "12:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 117.561,
      "end": 120.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for theirs is the kingdom of heaven.",
      "verse": "12:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 120.795,
      "end": 123.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed are ye when men shall revile you",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 123.901,
      "end": 125.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and persecute,",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 125.474,
      "end": 129.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall say all manner of evil against you falsely, for my sake;",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 129.962,
      "end": 133.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For ye shall have great joy and be exceedingly glad,",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 133.3,
      "end": 135.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for great shall be your reward in heaven;",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 135.988,
      "end": 139.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for so persecuted they the prophets who were before you.",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 140.151,
      "end": 142.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 142.653,
      "end": 145.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I give unto you to be the salt of the earth;",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 145.527,
      "end": 147.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but if the salt shall lose its savor",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 148.075,
      "end": 150.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherewith shall the earth be salted?",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 150.716,
      "end": 154.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The salt shall be thenceforth good for nothing,",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 154.193,
      "end": 157.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but to be cast out and to be trodden under foot of men.",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 158.356,
      "end": 160.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 160.858,
      "end": 163.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I give unto you to be the light of this people.",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 163.639,
      "end": 166.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "A city that is set on a hill cannot be hid.",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 167.338,
      "end": 170.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, do men light a candle and put it under a bushel?",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 170.722,
      "end": 172.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay, but on a candlestick,",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 172.62,
      "end": 175.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it giveth light to all that are in the house;",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 176.226,
      "end": 179.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore let your light so shine before this people,",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 179.657,
      "end": 182.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may see your good works",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 182.298,
      "end": 184.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and glorify your Father who is in heaven.",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 185.393,
      "end": 188.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Think not that I am come to destroy the law or the prophets.",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 189.01,
      "end": 191.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am not come to destroy but to fulfil;",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 192.151,
      "end": 194.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For verily I say unto you,",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 194.235,
      "end": 197.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "one jot nor one tittle hath not passed away from the law,",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 197.666,
      "end": 200.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but in me it hath all been fulfilled.",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 200.714,
      "end": 202.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I have given you",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 202.937,
      "end": 205.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the law and the commandments of my Father,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 205.903,
      "end": 207.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye shall believe in me,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 207.755,
      "end": 210.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye shall repent of your sins,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 210.303,
      "end": 213.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and come unto me with a broken heart and a contrite spirit.",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 214.152,
      "end": 216.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, ye have the commandments before you,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 216.84,
      "end": 218.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the law is fulfilled.",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 219.192,
      "end": 221.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore come unto me and be ye saved;",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 221.926,
      "end": 228.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for verily I say unto you, that except ye shall keep my commandments, which I have commanded you at this time,",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 229.165,
      "end": 232.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall in no case enter into the kingdom of heaven.",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 232.864,
      "end": 236.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye have heard that it hath been said by them of old time,",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 236.481,
      "end": 238.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it is also written before you,",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 238.937,
      "end": 240.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thou shalt not kill,",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 240.603,
      "end": 244.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whosoever shall kill shall be in danger of the judgment of God;",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 245.37,
      "end": 250.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I say unto you, that whosoever is angry with his brother shall be in danger of his judgment.",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 250.937,
      "end": 255.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whosoever shall say to his brother, Raca, shall be in danger of the council;",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 255.761,
      "end": 261.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whosoever shall say, Thou fool, shall be in danger of hell fire.",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 261.735,
      "end": 263.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, if ye shall come unto me,",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 264.051,
      "end": 266.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or shall desire to come unto me,",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 266.414,
      "end": 269.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rememberest that thy brother hath aught against thee\u2014",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 270.623,
      "end": 272.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go thy way unto thy brother,",
      "verse": "12:24",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 272.893,
      "end": 275.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and first be reconciled to thy brother,",
      "verse": "12:24",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 275.534,
      "end": 278.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then come unto me with full purpose of heart,",
      "verse": "12:24",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 278.686,
      "end": 280.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will receive you.",
      "verse": "12:24",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 280.899,
      "end": 283.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Agree with thine adversary quickly",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 283.401,
      "end": 285.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while thou art in the way with him,",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 285.949,
      "end": 288.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest at any time he shall get thee,",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 288.637,
      "end": 290.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou shalt be cast into prison.",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 291.593,
      "end": 293.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto thee,",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 293.956,
      "end": 296.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt by no means come out thence",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 296.319,
      "end": 298.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until thou hast paid the uttermost senine.",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 298.914,
      "end": 302.583,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And while ye are in prison can ye pay even one senine?",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 302.763,
      "end": 304.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you, Nay.",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 305.626,
      "end": 308.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it is written by them of old time,",
      "verse": "12:27",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 308.5,
      "end": 310.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thou shalt not commit adultery;",
      "verse": "12:27",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 311.641,
      "end": 313.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I say unto you,",
      "verse": "12:28",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 313.4,
      "end": 317.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whosoever looketh on a woman, to lust after her,",
      "verse": "12:28",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 317.202,
      "end": 320.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hath committed adultery already in his heart.",
      "verse": "12:28",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 320.808,
      "end": 323.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I give unto you a commandment,",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 323.774,
      "end": 327.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye suffer none of these things to enter into your heart;",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 328.169,
      "end": 331.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it is better that ye should deny yourselves of these things,",
      "verse": "12:30",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 331.739,
      "end": 334.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherein ye will take up your cross,",
      "verse": "12:30",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 334.195,
      "end": 336.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than that ye should be cast into hell.",
      "verse": "12:30",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 337.058,
      "end": 340.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "It hath been written, that whosoever shall put away his wife,",
      "verse": "12:31",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 341.093,
      "end": 343.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let him give her a writing of divorcement.",
      "verse": "12:31",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 344.374,
      "end": 346.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "12:32",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 346.876,
      "end": 353.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whosoever shall put away his wife, saving for the cause of fornication, causeth her to commit adultery;",
      "verse": "12:32",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 354.115,
      "end": 358.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whoso shall marry her who is divorced committeth adultery.",
      "verse": "12:32",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 358.696,
      "end": 360.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again it is written,",
      "verse": "12:33",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 360.548,
      "end": 362.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt not forswear thyself,",
      "verse": "12:33",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 362.678,
      "end": 365.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but shalt perform unto the Lord thine oaths;",
      "verse": "12:33",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 366.098,
      "end": 369.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But verily, verily, I say unto you, swear not at all;",
      "verse": "12:34",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 370.179,
      "end": 372.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither by heaven, for it is God's throne;",
      "verse": "12:34",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 373.46,
      "end": 376.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nor by the earth, for it is his footstool;",
      "verse": "12:35",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 376.834,
      "end": 379.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Neither shalt thou swear by thy head,",
      "verse": "12:36",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 379.382,
      "end": 382.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because thou canst not make one hair black or white;",
      "verse": "12:36",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 383.173,
      "end": 386.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But let your communication be Yea, yea; Nay, nay;",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 386.232,
      "end": 389.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for whatsoever cometh of more than these is evil.",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 390.163,
      "end": 392.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, it is written,",
      "verse": "12:38",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 392.433,
      "end": 395.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "an eye for an eye, and a tooth for a tooth;",
      "verse": "12:38",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 395.992,
      "end": 399.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I say unto you that ye shall not resist evil,",
      "verse": "12:39",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 399.237,
      "end": 404.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but whosoever shall smite thee on thy right cheek, turn to him the other also;",
      "verse": "12:39",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 404.979,
      "end": 408.601,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if any man will sue thee at the law and take away thy coat,",
      "verse": "12:40",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 408.781,
      "end": 410.778,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let him have thy cloak also;",
      "verse": "12:40",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 411.458,
      "end": 415.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whosoever shall compel thee to go a mile, go with him twain.",
      "verse": "12:41",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 415.76,
      "end": 417.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Give to him that asketh thee,",
      "verse": "12:42",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 418.03,
      "end": 421.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and from him that would borrow of thee turn thou not away.",
      "verse": "12:42",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 421.914,
      "end": 424.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold it is written also,",
      "verse": "12:43",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 424.23,
      "end": 427.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thou shalt love thy neighbor and hate thine enemy;",
      "verse": "12:43",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 428.486,
      "end": 432.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold I say unto you, love your enemies, bless them that curse you,",
      "verse": "12:44",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 432.985,
      "end": 435.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do good to them that hate you,",
      "verse": "12:44",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 435.348,
      "end": 439.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and pray for them who despitefully use you and persecute you;",
      "verse": "12:44",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 440.161,
      "end": 443.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That ye may be the children of your Father who is in heaven;",
      "verse": "12:45",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 443.87,
      "end": 447.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he maketh his sun to rise on the evil and on the good.",
      "verse": "12:45",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 447.894,
      "end": 451.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore those things which were of old time,",
      "verse": "12:46",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 451.278,
      "end": 452.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were under the law,",
      "verse": "12:46",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 453.037,
      "end": 454.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in me are all fulfilled.",
      "verse": "12:46",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 455.482,
      "end": 457.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Old things are done away,",
      "verse": "12:47",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 457.38,
      "end": 459.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all things have become new.",
      "verse": "12:47",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 459.778,
      "end": 462.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore I would that ye should be perfect",
      "verse": "12:48",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 462.977,
      "end": 466.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as I, or your Father who is in heaven is perfect.",
      "verse": "12:48",
      "lineIndex": 150
    }
  ]
}